{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44264","headline":"遣怀 · 鱼玄机","name":"遣怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲散身无事，风光独自游。\n断云江上月，解缆海中舟。\n琴弄萧梁寺，诗吟庾亮楼。\n丛篁堪作伴，片石好爲俦。\n燕雀徒爲贵，金银志不求。\n满杯春酒绿，对月夜窗幽。\n绕砌澄清沼，抽簪映细流。\n卧牀书册徧，半醉起梳头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}